    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d460">

                <pb facs="0631" n="507" xml:id="pg507"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">894.51 Or 4/27: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Wilson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract—Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-03-26T15:00:00+09:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 26,
                                1923—3 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received March 26—9:18
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>29. … Farnham as agent for the National City Company on March 24 signed a
                    contract with the Oriental Development Company for a loan of $19,900,000, which
                    is the equivalent of 40,000,000 yen. …</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
